{
 "id": "seg3",
 "title": "前排拦截",
 "pill": 3,
 "total": 117.52,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg3-00",
   "text": "从早到晚，能拦钱的地方排成一列。",
   "spoken": "从早到晚，能拦钱的地方排成一列。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg3-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 3.28,
   "speechStart": 1.6,
   "speechEnd": 4.688
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-01",
   "text": "最靠前的，是协议自己的暂停和延迟提款。",
   "spoken": "最靠前的，是协议自己的暂停和延迟提款。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg3-01.wav",
   "start": 5.1,
   "dur": 4.64,
   "speechStart": 5.195,
   "speechEnd": 9.571
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-02",
   "text": "条件是合约里事先设计了暂停或延迟机制，而且有人值守。",
   "spoken": "条件是合约里事先设计了暂停或延迟机制，而且有人值守。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg3-02.wav",
   "start": 9.96,
   "dur": 5.84,
   "speechStart": 9.96,
   "speechEnd": 15.556
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-03",
   "text": "Bybit 被盗后，mETH Protocol 靠 8 小时的提款延迟，暂停了合约，追回约 4300 万美元的 cmETH。",
   "spoken": "Bybit 被盗后，mETH Protocol 靠 8 小时的提款延迟，暂停了合约，追回约 4300 万美元的 cmETH。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg3-03.wav",
   "start": 16.02,
   "dur": 9.04,
   "speechStart": 16.112,
   "speechEnd": 24.874
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-04",
   "text": "这是那次事件里，追回最多的单项。",
   "spoken": "这是那次事件里，追回最多的单项。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg3-04.wav",
   "start": 25.28,
   "dur": 2.64,
   "speechStart": 25.375,
   "speechEnd": 27.685
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-05",
   "text": "第二道，是稳定币发行方冻结。",
   "spoken": "第二道，是稳定币发行方冻结。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg3-05.wav",
   "start": 28.14,
   "dur": 2.88,
   "speechStart": 28.234,
   "speechEnd": 30.831
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-06",
   "text": "Tether、Circle 这类发行方，可以在合约层面冻结一个地址。",
   "spoken": "Tether、Circle 这类发行方，可以在合约层面冻结一个地址。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg3-06.wav",
   "start": 31.24,
   "dur": 4.8,
   "speechStart": 31.24,
   "speechEnd": 35.801
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-07",
   "text": "2024 年 9 月，Tether、TRON 和 TRM 联合成立了 T3 金融犯罪部门。",
   "spoken": "2024 年 9 月，Tether、TRON 和 TRM 联合成立了 T3 金融犯罪部门。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg3-07.wav",
   "start": 36.26,
   "dur": 6.24,
   "speechStart": 36.26,
   "speechEnd": 42.236
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-08",
   "text": "2026 年 5 月，T3 自报累计冻结 4.5 亿美元以上。",
   "spoken": "2026 年 5 月，T3 自报垒计冻结 4.5 亿美元以上。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg3-08.wav",
   "start": 42.72,
   "dur": 4.8,
   "speechStart": 42.825,
   "speechEnd": 47.308
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-09",
   "text": "可这条路，有门槛，有时延，也可能被撤销。",
   "spoken": "可这条路，有门槛，有时延，也可能被撤销。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg3-09.wav",
   "start": 47.74,
   "dur": 4.32,
   "speechStart": 47.838,
   "speechEnd": 51.837
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-10",
   "text": "门槛是，通常要有执法请求或法院命令。",
   "spoken": "门槛是，通常要有执法请求或法院命令。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg3-10.wav",
   "start": 52.28,
   "dur": 4.32,
   "speechStart": 52.379,
   "speechEnd": 56.377
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-11",
   "text": "撤销的例子，是 2025 年 5 月的 LIBRA 案。",
   "spoken": "撤销的例子，是 2025 年 5 月的 LIBRA 案。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg3-11.wav",
   "start": 56.82,
   "dur": 3.68,
   "speechStart": 56.82,
   "speechEnd": 60.315
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-12",
   "text": "Circle 依据纽约南区法院的临时限制令，冻结了约 5760 万美元 USDC。",
   "spoken": "Circle 依据纽约南区法院的临时限制令，冻结了约 5760 万美元 USDC。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg3-12.wav",
   "start": 60.72,
   "dur": 7.2,
   "speechStart": 60.72,
   "speechEnd": 67.731
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-13",
   "text": "8 月，法官解除了冻结，理由是原告没有证明不可弥补的损害。",
   "spoken": "8 月，法官解除了冻结，理由是原告没有证明不可弥补的损害。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg3-13.wav",
   "start": 68.14,
   "dur": 5.76,
   "speechStart": 68.242,
   "speechEnd": 73.732
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-14",
   "text": "时延的例子，是 2026 年 4 月的 Drift 被盗事件。",
   "spoken": "时延的例子，是 2026 年 4 月的 Drift 被盗事件。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg3-14.wav",
   "start": 74.12,
   "dur": 4.4,
   "speechStart": 74.12,
   "speechEnd": 78.347
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-15",
   "text": "链上调查者 ZachXBT，公开批评 Circle 延迟了约 6 小时，期间约 2.32 亿美元经跨链协议转走。",
   "spoken": "链上掉查者 ZachXBT，公开批评 Circle 延迟了约 6 小时，期间约 2.32 亿美元经跨链协议转走。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg3-15.wav",
   "start": 78.74,
   "dur": 9.28,
   "speechStart": 78.832,
   "speechEnd": 87.831
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-16",
   "text": "这是个人指控，未见 Circle 回应。",
   "spoken": "这是个人指控，未见 Circle 回应。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg3-16.wav",
   "start": 88.24,
   "dur": 2.32,
   "speechStart": 88.334,
   "speechEnd": 90.32
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-17",
   "text": "美国 GENIUS 法案在 2025 年 7 月成为法律，要求支付型稳定币发行方，有能力执行冻结、扣押、阻止转账这类合法命令。",
   "spoken": "美国 GENIUS 法案在 2025 年 7 月成为法律，要求支付型稳定币发行方，有能力执行冻结、扣押、阻止转账这类合法命令。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg3-17.wav",
   "start": 90.78,
   "dur": 10.96,
   "speechStart": 90.873,
   "speechEnd": 101.575
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-18",
   "text": "第三道，是交易所冻结。",
   "spoken": "第三道，是交易所冻结。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg3-18.wav",
   "start": 101.96,
   "dur": 2.4,
   "speechStart": 101.96,
   "speechEnd": 104.137
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-19",
   "text": "条件是交易所收到可信的地址清单，或者风控名单命中，时效在小时级。",
   "spoken": "条件是交易所收到可信的地址清单，或者风控名单命中，时效在小时级。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg3-19.wav",
   "start": 104.58,
   "dur": 7.12,
   "speechStart": 104.58,
   "speechEnd": 111.503
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-20",
   "text": "局限也很明显，攻击者会避开合规交易所。",
   "spoken": "局限也很明显，攻击者会避开合规交易所。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg3-20.wav",
   "start": 111.92,
   "dur": 4.4,
   "speechStart": 111.92,
   "speechEnd": 116.081
  }
